    "clinicalContext": "Sustained monomorphic ventricular tachycardia in a patient with known structural heart disease (ischemic cardiomyopathy, LVEF 25%) and CKD. The episode was hemodynamically borderline but the patient remained conscious. The event occurred in the context of baseline sinus rhythm with LBBB-like conduction.",
